    <Placemark>
      <name>Seafood Platter</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Seafood Platter</b><br><i>Food &amp; Drink</i><br>Fri 12th Jun – Mon 31st Aug<br>Golden Century, Barangaroo<br>$198<br><br>seafood platter showcases the finest live selections, brought together with the signature depth and precision of Cantonese cuisine. From delicate textures to bold, umami-rich flavours, each dish is crafted to honour both tradition and quality. Indulge in live pipis with Golden Century's signature XO sauce on fried verm<br><br><a href="https://www.barangaroo.com/whats-on/events/seafood-platter">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#red-dot.png</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>151.202265,-33.877815,0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
