      <name>Typhoon Shelter Style Lobster</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Typhoon Shelter Style Lobster</b><br><i>Food &amp; Drink</i><br>Fri 12th Jun – Mon 31st Aug<br>Golden Century, Barangaroo<br>$198<br><br>Typhoon Shelter style lobster is delicately layered with fragrant aromatics: onion, ginger, garlic and black bean. The gentle spice enhancing the natural sweetness of the premium live lobster and crab, creating a dish that is both rich and perfectly balanced. Elevate the experience with an exclusive pairing of 2008 Châ<br><br><a href="https://www.barangaroo.com/whats-on/events/typhoon-shelter-style-lobster">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#red-dot.png</styleUrl>
